# 🚀 Quick Start Guide

## Prerequisites

- Node.js 18+ installed
- Git installed
- Free accounts created:
  - [Supabase](https://supabase.com)
  - [OpenAI](https://platform.openai.com)
  - [ElevenLabs](https://elevenlabs.io) (optional)
  - [Twilio](https://www.twilio.com) (optional)

## Installation (5 Minutes)

### 1. Clone/Download Project

```bash
cd digimark101
npm install
```

### 2. Setup Environment

```bash
cp .env.example .env.local
```

Edit `.env.local` and add your API keys:

```bash
# Get from: https://supabase.com/dashboard > Settings > API
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=your_url_here
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your_key_here
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your_service_key_here

# Get from: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-your_key_here

# Optional - Get from: https://elevenlabs.io/app/settings/api-keys
ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=your_key_here

# Optional - Get from: https://console.twilio.com
TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID=ACxxxxx
TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN=your_token
TWILIO_PHONE_NUMBER=+1234567890
```

### 3. Setup Database

1. Go to your Supabase project
2. Click "SQL Editor"
3. Copy contents from `supabase/migrations/initial_schema.sql`
4. Paste and run

### 4. Add Your Images

Add these files to `public/assets/`:
- `ava-skye.png` (Your Ava photo)
- `digimark101-logo.svg` (Your logo)

### 5. Start Development

```bash
npm run dev
```

Open http://localhost:3000

## Deploy to Production

```bash
# Install Vercel CLI
npm install -g vercel

# Deploy
vercel

# Add environment variables in Vercel dashboard
```

## Troubleshooting

### Voice not working?
- Chrome/Edge required for voice recognition
- HTTPS required (works on localhost)
- Check microphone permissions

### Database errors?
- Verify Supabase credentials in `.env.local`
- Check SQL migration ran successfully

### Images not showing?
- Verify files are in `public/assets/`
- Clear browser cache

## Next Steps

1. Create test account
2. Talk to Ava
3. Explore features
4. Customize branding

Need help? Check `docs/TROUBLESHOOTING.md`
